title: "A Lean 4 Formalization of the Guth–Maynard Zero-Density Argument and Its Analytic Inputs"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-08-29"
repository-code: "https://github.com/smccolm/Lean/tree/main/Riemann%20Zeta"
abstract: >-
  Kernel-checked Lean 4 formalization of the Guth–Maynard large-values and
  zero-density chain, including exact publication-facing contracts, classical
  density inputs, and the project-specific analytic consumers used by the
  transfer. Independent semantic review and publication of the formalization
  are not claimed.
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - formalized mathematics
  - analytic number theory
  - Riemann zeta function
  - zero-density estimates
